<title>USA: Children's Wonderland names new president.</title>
<headline>Children's Wonderland names new president.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Children's Wonderland Inc said it appointed Michael Laney as president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Laney joins Children's Wonderland from Time Warner Inc's Warner Brothers Feature Animation, where he was a senior vice president of operations.</p>
<p>Laney replaces Robert Wilson, who became a consultant to the company and will play a key role in acquisition development.  Wilson remains on the Board of Directors.</p>
</text>
